<div class="card bg-dark mt-4 mb-4" id="admin-guide">
	<div class="card-header custom-header text-center">
		<h3>
			<i class="fas fa-user-shield"></i> Admin Guide
		</h3>
	</div>
	<div class="card-body">
		<h4 class="highlight">Dashboard Overview</h4>
		<p>The admin dashboard provides a comprehensive view of your
			parking facilities with real-time occupancy rates, revenue metrics,
			and operational insights.</p>

		<div class="row mt-4">
			<div class="col-md-6">
				<h5 class="text-success">Facility Management</h5>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Add/Edit Parking Areas</strong> - Configure
						parking zones, levels, and individual spots</li>
					<li><strong>Set Pricing Rules</strong> - Define hourly, daily
						rates and special event pricing</li>
					<li><strong>Maintenance Mode</strong> - Mark spots as
						unavailable during maintenance</li>
					<li><strong>Capacity Planning</strong> - View utilization
						reports to optimize space usage</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-6">
				<h5 class="text-success">Reservation Management</h5>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>View All Bookings</strong> - Filter by date,
						location, or status</li>
					<li><strong>Manual Entry</strong> - Create bookings for
						walk-in customers</li>
					<li><strong>Modify Reservations</strong> - Change time,
						duration, or assigned spot</li>
					<li><strong>Batch Processing</strong> - Manage multiple
						reservations simultaneously</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="row mt-3">
			<div class="col-md-6">
				<h5 class="text-success">Financial Operations</h5>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Revenue Tracking</strong> - Monitor daily, weekly,
						and monthly earnings</li>
					<li><strong>Payment Processing</strong> - Handle refunds and
						payment disputes</li>
					<li><strong>Financial Reports</strong> - Generate detailed
						revenue reports by zone/period</li>
					<li><strong>Rate Management</strong> - Set and update parking
						rates for different zones and times</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-6">
				<h5 class="text-success">User Management</h5>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Account Approval</strong> - Review and approve new
						user registrations</li>
					<li><strong>User Permissions</strong> - Manage access levels
						for different admin accounts</li>
					<li><strong>Activity Logs</strong> - Monitor system actions
						for security purposes</li>
					<li><strong>Customer Support</strong> - Respond to user
						inquiries and issues</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h5 class="mt-4 text-warning">Rate Configuration</h5>
		<p>As an administrator, you can configure parking rates based on:</p>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Time-based Pricing</strong> - Different rates for
				peak and off-peak hours</li>
			<li><strong>Zone-based Pricing</strong> - Premium rates for
				convenient locations</li>
			<li><strong>Vehicle Type</strong> - Different rates for cars,
				motorcycles, and oversized vehicles</li>
			<li><strong>Special Events</strong> - Custom pricing for events
				at nearby venues</li>
			<li><strong>Promotional Offers</strong> - Create limited-time
				discounts and offers</li>
		</ul>

		<h5 class="mt-4 text-danger">Security Protocols</h5>
		<p>As an administrator, ensure you follow these security best
			practices:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Change your password every 60 days</li>
			<li>Enable two-factor authentication for your admin account</li>
			<li>Log out when stepping away from your workstation</li>
			<li>Review access logs regularly for suspicious activity</li>
			<li>Use the "Admin Actions" log to document changes for
				accountability</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</div>